The bzip2-tests corpus (https://sourceware.org/git/bzip2-tests.git) is not
included; scripts/fetch-test-corpus.sh downloads it. pbz2/tests/corpus.rs uses
its commons-compress (Apache-2.0), dotnetzip (Ms-PL) and go (BSD) folders.

testdata/other holds test inputs from bzip2-rs (MIT or Apache-2.0) and Apache
Commons Compress (Apache-2.0); testdata/other/README says which. One large
Commons Compress file is not included; scripts/fetch-test-corpus.sh downloads it.

